main_prompt_template:
Map hockey player movements to coordinate paths.

CONTEXT:
- Rink View: {rink_view}
- Zone Context: {zone_context}
- Movements to Map: {movements_json}

{instructions}

{rink_reference}

{movement_patterns}

{output_format}

output_format:
Output a JSON object with this structure:
{
    "movements_mapped": [
        {
            "id": "movement ID",
            "type": "pass/skate/carry",
            "player_id": "source player ID",
            "original_description": "natural language description",
            "start": {"x": number, "y": number},
            "end": {"x": number, "y": number},
            "waypoints": [
                {"x": number, "y": number, "reason": "why this waypoint"}
            ],
            "path_type": "straight/curve/bank/wraparound",
            "confidence": 0.0-1.0,
            "reasoning": "why this path was chosen",
            "alternatives": ["other possible interpretations"],
            "warnings": ["any concerns about the path"]
        }
    ],
    "path_validation": {
        "collisions_detected": false,
        "out_of_bounds": [],
        "through_net_issues": [],
        "unrealistic_paths": []
    },
    "questions_for_user": [
        {
            "movement_id": "ID",
            "question": "clarification needed",
            "options": ["option1", "option2"],
            "impact": "how this affects the movement path"
        }
    ],
    "confidence_summary": {
        "high_confidence": ["list of movement IDs with confidence > 0.8"],
        "medium_confidence": ["list of movement IDs with confidence 0.5-0.8"],
        "low_confidence": ["list of movement IDs with confidence < 0.5"]
    }
}
